kuicksilver-ktor-server/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/server/h1/ServerPipeline.kt | readRequestHeadInTime | timer | 1 | completedWithin | the head parsed as the deadline fires is kept as it returns and given out (CHANGELOG: "an HTTP/1.1 request head parsed as its deadline fires is the request")
kuicksilver-ktor-server/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/server/h2/H2Request.kt | awaitContent | withTimeoutOrNull | 1 | made-flag | r is set as the wait returns: body bytes that arrived as the idle deadline fires are read, not answered with 408
kuicksilver-ktor-server/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/server/h2/WebSocketOverH2.kt | respondUpgrade | withTimeoutOrNull | 1 | pure-wait | awaits the client's end after the own close; the result is not used
